        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/wildwood-113973",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Nestled in Sevier County, Wildwood lies within the Appalachian region just outside the Great Smoky Mountains National Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
